1. Get unburdened. Go downstairs, drop everything you don't on the stairs 
up and go straight back up. Nothing can pinch it then (except possibly if 
you chase something down the stairs onto it). Better, go and get a chest 
(you must have seen one somewhere) bring it to the right level, and fill 
it.

2. Don't carry any gold openly on your person. If you aren't carrying gold 
then at least the leprechauns won't teleport away from you. If you kill 
any, put their gold in a bag, in your cache, or drop it down the stairs.

3. Eat the troll, or tin it.

4. Next time, don't get teleportitis until you also have a way to control 
it. Its not as though it were something that happens by accident.
 
